	<div class="col-lg-5 col-md-6">


<h4>Life at PackOasis</h4>
<p>Take part of an exciting opportunity to reshape the packaging industry with PackOasis. Do interesting, meaningful work for a constantly growing company that’s set to achieve something big. Work with an amazing group of individuals everyday and reach your goals with learning opportunities and support from some of the industry’s best.</p>
		<a class="btn btn-primary " href="#opportunities">View Open Positions</a> 

		</div>

	
